<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE/CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE/CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of English league and Cup</p>
<p>soccer matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>Premier league</p>
<p> Derby		     2  Middlesbrough	   1</p>
<p>Division one</p>
<p> Wolverhampton	   1  Birmingham		2</p>
<p>Football Association (F.A.) Cup first round</p>
<p> Newcastle Town	  0  Notts County	    2</p>
<p>(winners at home to Rochdale in second round)</p>
<p> Northampton	     0  Watford		   1</p>
<p>(winners at home to Ashford or Dagenham)</p>
<p> Whitby Town	     0- Hull			0</p>
<p>(Replay November 26, eventual winners at home to Crewe)</p>
</text>
